boden, Thierry and Vatier, Camille and Verger, Eric and Walther, Stefanie and Dumas, Marc-Emmanuel and Ehrlich, Stanislav Dusko and Galan, Pilar and G{\o}tze, Jens P. and Hansen, Torben and Holst, Jens J. and K{\o}ber, Lars and Letunic, Ivica and Nielsen, Jens and Oppert, Jean-Michel and Stumvoll, Michael and Vestergaard, Henrik and Zucker, Jean-Daniel and Bork, Peer and Pedersen, Oluf and B{\"a}ckhed, Fredrik and Cl{\'e}ment, Karine and Raes, Jeroen},
